# master-off.vrs: [General] Enabled=false turns every feature off for an admin, while the cleanup commands still work.
# Needs config: General.Enabled=false (feature switches all on).
ensure
console TPHome
wait 3
mark
chat .uriel features
expect-reply Master switch [General] Enabled is OFF
expect-seen \[CHAT> ${CHARACTER}\] Uriel features:.*Stair swap OFF\. Object spawning OFF\. NPC units and castle events OFF, event doors OFF\. Public chests OFF, prison cells OFF, paid shares OFF\.
chat .uriel stairstyles
expect-reply Stair swapping is disabled by the server admin.
chat .uriel spawn TM_Glassblower_Crate01 here
expect-reply Object spawning is disabled by the server admin
chat .uriel unit spawn CHAR_Bandit_Thug 1
expect-reply Castle events are disabled by the server admin (CastleEvents.Enabled).
chat .uriel event list
expect-reply Castle events are disabled by the server admin (CastleEvents.Enabled).
chat .uriel share
expect-reply Public storage is disabled by the server admin.
# cleanup still answers
chat .uriel unit list
expect-reply No Uriel units
chat .uriel event stopall
expect-reply No castle event is running.
chat .uriel purgeorphans
expect-reply Orphan scan complete
chat .uriel killswitch
expect-reply Run '.uriel killswitch confirm' within 30 s
chat .uriel killswitch confirm
expect-reply Kill switch done: 0 event(s) stopped
expect-log \[Uriel KILLSWITCH\] why=command events=0
console TPHome
